WEBVTT

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:04.480
Northern Stellar Region Asteroid Belt

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:07.730
Vicinity of Asteroid 13774/a Spurný

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.430
(Long-Range Assault Setup)
Buster Machine, Dix-Neuf

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:13.980
Fourth rotation finished.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:14.570
(Long-Range Assault Setup)
Buster Machine, Dix-Neuf

00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:17.320
<i>Dix-Neuf</i>, we're going to go get resupplied.

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:24.830
Jupiter Express (Group 51-<b><i>β</i>-7062)</b>

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.090
There's just too many of them, I can't even stall them.

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:40.870
Give me two Mos Chicken Buster Combos and an order of small-size Napa Nuggets.

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:42.350
Got it! Coming right up!

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:45.030
Ten thousand rounds, here you go!

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:51.270
You're good at this.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.620
Oh, not at all. You're the good one, Onee-sama!

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:57.670
Fifth rotation, resupply at 1200.

00:00:58.220 --> 00:00:59.120
Roger.

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:06.170
Tycho! You're ignoring the rotation again!

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:09.130
Buster Machine · <i>Soixante-Six</i>

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:12.320
Hmph! Your time as a Curve Wrecker is...

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:14.040
...up!

00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:21.950
I'll take these guys down and turn our positions on the scoreboard around!

00:01:26.050 --> 00:01:29.650
Reeling 'em in! I'm right on the verge of a turnaround! Go, go!

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:38.090
Er... huh?

00:01:45.190 --> 00:01:47.080
Tycho! Were you shot down?

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:50.450
I screwed up. I was so close to becoming the top...

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:01.330
It's snow...

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:27.960
There! Miss Tycho's distress beacon.

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:29.980
Tycho, come in!

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:33.340
Well, if it isn't the Princess! I owe you one.

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:36.690
Now that you've been bumped down to unassigned...

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:38.380
you won't be able to beat my score, will you?

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:40.840
Looks like I win again this year.

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:44.820
There's no holding a candle to the Curve Wrecker.

00:02:44.820 --> 00:02:47.570
Don't talk any more. We'll find you any second now.

00:02:58.690 --> 00:03:01.840
Groovin' magic
Groovin' magic

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:05.230
yorisoeba itsudemo
Whenever we're close to each other

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:11.870
kitsuku musunda kutsuhimo ga mune wo kyun to saseru
My firmly tied shoelaces make my heart twinge

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:34.260
se no takai anata ga mioroshite iru no yo
You're looking down on me from your tall height

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:39.220
sotto kami wo naderu furi wo shite
I quietly pretend to stroke my hair

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:44.530
chikadzuite ki wo hikitai no
hoping to get closer and catch your eye

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:50.730
"dou shita no?" tte jirasanaide
"What's the matter?" Don't give me that

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:56.190
koi no countdown junbei wa itsudemo OK
Countdown to love, I'm ready anytime

00:03:56.190 --> 00:03:57.930
3, 2, 1, futari wa...
3, 2, 1, we're...

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:00.880
Groovin' magic
Groovin' magic

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:03.870
soda sui ni tokeru
Soluble in soda water

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:11.290
amaku setsunai koi no iro mune no kyun to saseru
The bittersweet color of love makes my heart twinge

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:41.000
<i>The power of the Topless exists for the sake of all people who long for peace.</i>

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:42.890
<i>As members of the Fraternity, sworn to use our talents as Topless in defense of the Sol System...</i>

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:45.010
That's Onee-sama, isn't it?

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:45.710
<i>As members of the Fraternity, sworn to use our talents as Topless in defense of the Sol System...</i>

00:04:45.710 --> 00:04:47.660
From last year. That was a Lunar Tokyo Swearing-In Ceremony.

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:48.420
we will demonstrate the results of our daily training to the fullest...

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:51.690
Every year, the highest scoring Topless serves as the Fraternity's representative...

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:52.400
in accordance with the spirit of perseverance, fair play, and friendship.

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.660
at the Space Force Administration General Meeting.

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:54.930
<i>in accordance with the spirit of perseverance, fair play, and friendship.</i>

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:56.690
It's just reading a prepared manuscript.

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:57.840
Brethren, family, and friends...

00:04:57.840 --> 00:05:00.370
In that case, I, Nono could do that!

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:03.560
Weren't you listening? It's a special privilege reserved for the top scorer.

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:04.020
<i>each and every planetary security force that supports and fights alongside us...</i>

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:06.200
Do something about my Buster Machine!

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:06.940
as well as all of the officers in the Space Force.

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:09.440
Reconstructing <i>Soixante-Six</i> is impossible.

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:09.850
With our deepest gratitude towards all people...

00:05:09.850 --> 00:05:10.510
<i>With our deepest gratitude towards all people...</i>

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:12.020
And it was one of a precious few Buster Machines, only 31 in the entire world...

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:16.290
we are ready to fight to the bitter end with smiles on our faces, no matter what we may face.

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:18.040
But I wanna be number one!

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:21.020
<i>And we hereby solemnly swear...</i>

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:25.090
<i>to lead all of mankind to happiness and prosperity, through our Topless abilities!</i>

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:26.380
I, Nono, swear it, too!

00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:28.550
<i>The recent massive gathering of Topless is speculated...</i>

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:30.090
Nono-chan's so comforting to be around...

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:30.500
to be related to the long-standing Jupiter Express problem, which...

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:33.950
<i>to be related to the long-standing Jupiter Express problem, which...</i>

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:40.410
<i>Attention, please. This transport will be arriving shortly, 15 minutes behind schedule...</i>

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:44.320
<i>at Europa International Spaceport, on Galileo Station.</i>

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:45.640
<i>The current time is 2:07 P.M. The local temperature is...</i>

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:47.280
That's Jupiter?!

00:05:47.330 --> 00:05:49.580
Fifth Planet in the Sol System

00:05:50.630 --> 00:05:53.630
Jupiter

00:05:56.330 --> 00:06:00.540
Episode 3: I Hate the Topless

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:02.790
All right, I'll start...

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:05.650
This operation is a huge one, done in collaboration with the Space Force...

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:09.790
and encompassing roughly half of the Buster Machines currently in service.

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:13.150
The swarm of space monsters, the Jupiter Express...

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:16.560
travels in an elliptical orbit which comes close Jupiter every 90 days.

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:20.010
And, having to close down the main artery of the Sol System...

00:06:20.010 --> 00:06:22.690
the Great Circle Route, every time this happens...

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:24.440
just doesn't sit well with those adults.

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:24.750
(Pilot of of Buster Machine · <i>Vingt-Deux</i>)
Goya Reishi

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:27.330
Why now? They've let it go on...

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:27.960
for decades already, haven't they?

00:06:27.960 --> 00:06:28.770
(Pilot of Buster Machine · <i>Trente-Six</i>)
Nhan Nuok Cham

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:29.690
For some reason, huh?
Nhan Nuok Cham

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:30.070
(Pilot of Buster Machine · <i>Cinquante-Cinq</i>)
Kartoffel Patata

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:32.170
Come to think of it, the twins aren't here and they thought it up.

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:32.600
(Pilot of Buster Machine · <i>Soixante-Un</i>)
Pasika Pesca Persicum

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:35.170
Rumor has it they're vacationing on Titan.

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:36.070
Titan?
(Pilot of Buster Machine · <i>Cinquante</i>)
Roy Anyan

00:06:36.070 --> 00:06:37.210
Why so far out in the boonies?

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:37.620
(Pilot of Buster Machine · <i>Soixante</i>)
Citron Limone

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:38.840
Geez... What are we, gophers for the twins?

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:40.380
The methane springs there are great for your skin!

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:40.950
Geez... What are we, gophers for the twins?

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:41.550
The methane springs there are great for your skin!

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:41.700
(Pilot of Buster Machine · <i>Quatre-Vingt-Sept</i>)
Gurka Kuksis

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:44.340
Well, how about getting in some sightseeing then?

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:45.920
If you don't like it, why don't you leave?

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:47.940
(Pilot of Buster Machine · <i>Dix-Neuf</i>)
Lal'C Mellk Mal

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:48.820
There it is.

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:49.740
There you have it...

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:51.090
straight from the Curve Wrecker's mouth.

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:52.900
In the first place...

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:54.280
(Pilot of Buster Machine · <i>Quatre-Vingt-Neuf</i>)
Lou Seun

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:56.330
We're one machine short for this operation.

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:58.850
Because of the screw up you "Candians" made.

00:06:58.900 --> 00:06:59.130
(The only former Topless allowed to participate)
Casio Takashiro

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:00.960
You're all so harsh...

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:03.440
Let's try to be a little more, uh, comforting...

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:05.220
Not a problem.

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:08.150
You know about the new model under construction, right?

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:08.690
(Pilot of Buster Machine · <i>Vingt-Sept</i>)
Nicolas Vacheron

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:10.690
We'll wrap up the outfitting for it and add it to our group.

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:13.490
Has the Buster Machine already awoken?

00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:15.280
There's no way it'd wake up that easily.

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:16.640
It's supposed to be the next in the series, after Lou's.

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:18.080
I've heard that even after getting outfitted, half of them get scrapped after never waking up.

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.330
Is it legless again?

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:22.580
The public corp's design bureau has its own reasons.

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:23.420
Who...

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:23.450
The public corp's design bureau has its own reasons.

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:25.940
Who's going to use it?

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:36.060
AAAAAAMMMM...

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:40.100
Am I, Nono, gonna be the new Buster Machine's pilot?!

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:46.350
I'm moved! Deeply moved! I've come one more step closer to Nono-Riri!

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:49.900
You dodo head! It's obviously going to be me!

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:53.280
All right, now I can beat Lal'C!

00:07:56.980 --> 00:08:01.380
It's here, it's here, here it is! She's so cool!

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:05.660
She's the first new model made in decades.

00:08:05.970 --> 00:08:08.930
Buster Machine · <i>Quatre-Vingt-Dix</i>

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:14.560
This one hasn't earned any combat experience yet...

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:18.890
so the pilot selection criteria's different from that of existing Buster Machines.

00:08:19.420 --> 00:08:20.540
What are you getting at?

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:23.600
Does that mean I, Nono, have a chance, too?

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:28.630
Whether a new Buster Machine wakes up or not is heavily influenced by its initial pilot.

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:31.940
And they say piloting skills are critical.

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:36.080
Onee-sama complimented me on that! I'm so proud!

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:38.420
So I haven't been selected yet?

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:42.450
Right now, Tycho-chan, you can't pilot any Buster Machine.

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:44.190
Regulations, y'know.

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:48.350
Jupiter, Southern Truss (Residential Sector)

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:50.350
Layer 271, 1b-3

00:08:50.390 --> 00:08:52.560
Welfare Bureau Hospital, Jupiter Branch

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:53.690
Space Radiation Ward

00:08:53.690 --> 00:08:54.420
Agh...

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:54.440
Space Radiation Ward

00:08:56.860 --> 00:08:58.710
Owww...!

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:03.660
Like that would be enough to give me space radiation syndrome!

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:07.880
Telling me I can't pilot a Buster Machine without medical certification...

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:10.790
See? There was no problem!

00:09:10.790 --> 00:09:13.160
After all, I'm the one who'll pilot <i>Quatre-Vingt-Dix</i>.

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:15.560
You mean we're rivals?

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:19.510
You don't get it at all...

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:21.740
Wait!

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:38.810
Huh? They did turn a corner here...

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:40.990
Stop! You can't do that in here!

00:09:42.340 --> 00:09:46.100
Let's get some fresh air and calm down.

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:47.060
Whoa!

00:10:01.270 --> 00:10:04.080
This is my first time visiting a space city this old!

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:10.400
It used to be ruins from way back, before mankind was confined to the Sol System.

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:14.040
Is it true that it's older than Lunar Tokyo?

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:18.530
It was a battleship built for the war against the space monsters.

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:22.870
It might've been happier if it had been sunken in battle...

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:25.750
if that would keep it from having to be seen in the dilapidated state...

00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:37.210
It smells all moldy!

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:39.530
A passageway from way back in its spaceships days...

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:42.080
It must have been left over after the partitioning.

00:10:43.710 --> 00:10:45.740
See? I told you she'd find it.

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:47.550
But is she the real thing?

00:10:47.550 --> 00:10:52.250
Has our secret base ever been discovered by adults? She's gotta be a Topless!

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:55.470
Oh, not at all, I'm still an apprentice!

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:57.420
Not you.

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:59.710
Ow ow, ow!

00:11:01.210 --> 00:11:03.050
Where are you kids from?

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:06.900
Going around stealing things half as a prank... What a bunch of shameless bastards!

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:09.110
We didn't think you'd come otherwise.

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:12.990
If you're a Topless, we've got a favor to ask.

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:14.840
Forget it.

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:16.110
Make the snow fall!

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:21.310
Snow, in a space city like this with no sky?

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:26.140
There!

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:32.520
Can't you see the snow?

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:34.300
But it never falls.

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:36.420
I think it's frozen 'cause it's too cold.

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:41.420
If all that white, sparkly stuff fell over us, it'd be totally fun, right?

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:46.850
Sis, make the snow fall!

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:51.300
Those are stars, aren't they?

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:56.810
So cute! Too cute! I wanna make a snowman with them!

00:11:57.140 --> 00:11:57.980
Really?

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:00.120
I won't do it!

00:12:00.420 --> 00:12:02.780
Now, now, Miss Tycho. That's not very adult-like.

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:04.110
Why?

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:07.280
If you're a Topless, you should be able to make everyone happy, right?

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:13.760
Have you ever considered a Buster Machine's happiness?

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:19.030
If this one manages to wake up...

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:22.850
it wouldn't hesitate to risk death and fight for humanity's sake.

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:26.580
I guess that's only natural, since it was built for that purpose...

00:12:27.240 --> 00:12:32.650
Did you ever have those sorts of thoughts when you were <i>Dix-Neuf</i>'s pilot?

00:12:33.340 --> 00:12:34.600
Not at all.

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:38.190
If you could speak with it even now, would you want to ask it that?

00:12:38.950 --> 00:12:44.080
If a kid like Nono-chan became <i>Quatre-Vingt-Dix</i>'s pilot, that'd probably make it happy.

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:46.110
That's not possible, though.

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:48.450
Nicola doesn't think so.

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:53.110
He seriously believes she's got the potential to be Topless.

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:59.460
Due to the long spell of methane rain we're having on Titan...

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:01.850
it's looking like the excavation's falling behind schedule.

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:04.090
Is the Jupiter Express matter going well?

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:07.520
Was it also you two who pulled enough strings to get us the new-model machine?

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:11.390
My, you'd be surprised at how many friends in high places our secret circle has.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:13.570
Isn't that right, dear sister?

00:13:13.570 --> 00:13:16.800
Mmm, Titan crab is just delicious!

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:18.760
Don't forget my dinner.

00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:22.860
Don't make a fuss. Just get to work as you're told for now.

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:25.550
How about that robot girl?

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:30.510
A lost Topless power... The twins' secret circle...

00:13:31.070 --> 00:13:33.550
A robot being targeted by the space monsters...

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:36.120
As I thought...

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:48.240
Nono's a Topless? Nono could get chosen?

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:52.760
If you're a Topless, you should be able to make everyone happy, right?

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:53.680
Of course!

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:57.180
We hereby solemnly swear to lead all of mankind...

00:13:57.530 --> 00:14:00.100
I wanna make a snowman with them!

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:02.280
Hey, make a snowman!

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:04.640
A girl like that...

00:14:06.090 --> 00:14:07.520
could never manage it!

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:23.390
The Jupiter Express's anticipated route...

00:14:23.390 --> 00:14:26.790
will sweep past the southern residential sector as usual.

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:30.620
After shooting out spatial mines at your respective designated points...

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:31.950
return immediately.

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:36.140
After 48 hours, we will spring the minefield in front of the enemy space monsters...

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:39.310
and drive them towards the northern non-residential sector...

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:41.560
where the Fraternity will spring our trap.

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:44.750
I hear you're expecting a lot of Nono.

00:14:45.810 --> 00:14:49.310
3, 2, 1... Release!

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:54.470
Next one, ready!

00:14:57.900 --> 00:15:00.480
You've got good piloting ability, huh?

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:03.460
Miss Tycho! We're in the middle of an operation. We'll get in trouble!

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:04.570
Switch off your marker.

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:06.370
Duel me!

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:15.910
Are you okay?

00:15:17.590 --> 00:15:22.060
You'd better go back now. I'm getting back to the operation, so...

00:15:26.810 --> 00:15:27.570
Nicola?

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:30.800
Nicola!

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:32.040
He's not here.

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:35.470
You're trying to resort to direct talks?

00:15:38.150 --> 00:15:43.380
That dodo head is in an unusual huff about not losing out to you.

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:45.290
<i>Quatre-Vingt-Dix</i> is mine.

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:48.620
You're digging yourself deeper.

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:50.960
Seriously worked up over someone like Nono?

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:51.840
Shut up.

00:15:52.750 --> 00:15:56.640
I can't forgive her, same as you!

00:15:58.500 --> 00:15:59.630
Of course!

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:06.230
We hereby solemnly swear to lead all of mankind to happiness and prosperity!

00:16:07.220 --> 00:16:11.410
Don't make promises you can't keep! Snow doesn't fall on Jupiter!

00:16:13.890 --> 00:16:16.770
Topless abilities can't make people happy!

00:16:17.150 --> 00:16:19.670
Can you use Topless abilities to heal the sick?

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:22.780
Can you use Topless abilities to eliminate crime? Or stop wars?

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:28.210
Can your Topless abilities let you meet someone who died?

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:31.950
Look, Nono's trying her hardest.

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:39.370
Nono just wants to become a space pilot and protect the people.

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:43.070
After all, she's a dodo head.

00:16:58.270 --> 00:16:59.940
Northern Truss, Rampart (Degeneracy Generator Core Ruins)

00:16:59.980 --> 00:17:00.220
Buster Machine · Vingt-Deux

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:02.320
Blocking off the Overzone...

00:17:02.320 --> 00:17:02.820
with 4 units from Darling Base on Venus.
Buster Machine · Vingt-Deux

00:17:02.820 --> 00:17:03.360
with 4 units from Darling Base on Venus.

00:17:03.360 --> 00:17:03.800
Buster Machine · Soixante

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:05.570
30 to minefield.

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:07.520
The operation is entering the third stage.

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:07.620
Turn mark, check. Outside mark, check.

00:17:07.620 --> 00:17:10.540
Southern Truss (Residential Sector)

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:12.810
The Candians are late.

00:17:12.810 --> 00:17:14.600
They've only got 2 units out!

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:15.910
Told you so.

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:18.390
Incoming! The advance guard's charging in!

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:41.040
They broke through!

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:41.980
Mobile defensive combat!

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:44.430
<i>Dix-Neuf</i>, let's go!

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:47.410
You don't have to move, Candian! Stay put!

00:17:47.410 --> 00:17:48.820
Take care of the last line of defense!

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:54.750
Dammit! They aren't being driven towards the northern sector at all!

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:56.570
They're headed for the southern truss!

00:17:56.570 --> 00:17:57.960
That's the area with the hospital!

00:17:58.670 --> 00:17:59.700
Those kids...!

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:03.520
Can't <i>Quatre-Vingt-Dix</i> get out here?

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:04.760
Citron, keep them back!

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:06.220
I, Nono, am boarding. To save the children, I have to fight with <i>Quatre-Vingt-Dix</i> right now!

00:18:06.220 --> 00:18:08.990
I am! Goya, what are you doing, acting on your own?!

00:18:08.990 --> 00:18:10.550
I, Nono, am boarding. To save the children, I have to fight with <i>Quatre-Vingt-Dix</i> right now!

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:12.850
It won't work! She's still asleep!

00:18:15.100 --> 00:18:19.060
Please, wake up! <i>Quatre-Vingt-Dix</i>! Wake up!

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:20.850
Outta the way!

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:24.900
I'll do it.

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:27.890
You can't, Miss Tycho.

00:18:27.890 --> 00:18:32.840
All you ever think about is your score... You won't even answer children's pleas...

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:36.410
You can't wake up a Buster Machine like that!

00:18:40.030 --> 00:18:44.560
BUSTER BEAM!

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:49.480
BUSTER MITE!

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:56.040
BURNING WALL!!!

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:37.720
I want to beat Lal'C.

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:41.440
I want to make her stop saying that at the swearing in ceremony.

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:47.340
The Topless making everyone happy, that's...

00:19:48.190 --> 00:19:48.980
That's a lie!

00:19:51.010 --> 00:19:54.840
Lookie lookie, they said I have an amazing power!

00:19:56.240 --> 00:19:58.540
I'll heal your sickness too, okay?

00:20:03.690 --> 00:20:08.630
Make a snowman with me on my birthday next month, okay?

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:10.370
It's a promise!

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:19.790
Do I look like a lady?

00:20:23.710 --> 00:20:26.980
The one who laughed, saying that it didn't suit me...

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:29.280
had space radiation syndrome.

00:20:31.050 --> 00:20:32.000
And I told him I'd heal him...

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:34.840
...exists for the sake of all people who long for peace.

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:40.660
<i>As members of the Fraternity, sworn to use our
talents as Topless in defense of the Sol System...</i>

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:44.340
<i>we will demonstrate the results of our daily training to the fullest...</i>

00:20:44.690 --> 00:20:47.830
I lied to him. I hurt him.

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:49.720
I loved him, and yet...

00:20:50.920 --> 00:20:54.190
The Topless are powerless. They can't save anyone!

00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:58.390
Not even those children in the hospital... But...

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:03.650
But, I...

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:09.230
A Buster Machine won't lend strength to someone who can't believe in herself!

00:21:09.970 --> 00:21:14.180
What do you want to do? You want to save the children, don't you?

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:43.360
But...

00:21:45.390 --> 00:21:47.820
I didn't want him to hate me.

00:21:59.280 --> 00:22:00.770
There's no end to them!

00:22:00.770 --> 00:22:03.740
The enemy's main force has broken through our lines. Candians, they're all yours!

00:22:04.140 --> 00:22:06.950
Nicola, let's do the Buster X Attack!

00:22:06.950 --> 00:22:10.070
There's too many of 'em! They're rushing straight into the southern truss!

00:22:10.070 --> 00:22:12.840
That's where the residential sector and hospital are...!

00:22:23.600 --> 00:22:26.770
<i>Quatre-Vingt-Dix</i>! Who is it?

00:22:37.720 --> 00:22:41.330
I'll protect them. We can handle it, right, <i>Quatre-Vingt-Dix</i>?

00:22:42.970 --> 00:22:47.040
Physical canceler full power! Exotic Maneuver!!

00:22:57.630 --> 00:22:59.580
I even threw away the earrings...

00:23:00.930 --> 00:23:02.890
He'd never forgive me now...

00:23:03.900 --> 00:23:07.590
This isn't for him. This is for me.

00:23:16.230 --> 00:23:20.180
Buster...

00:23:22.220 --> 00:23:24.090
SMASH!

00:23:33.130 --> 00:23:37.380
There it is, the freezing beam theorized to reach negative one trillion, twenty million degrees!

00:23:37.380 --> 00:23:39.380
Negative one trillion, twenty million?!

00:23:39.380 --> 00:23:43.890
Such temperatures don't physically exist... What's going to happen?

00:24:06.720 --> 00:24:07.650
Stars...?

00:24:10.480 --> 00:24:12.360
The stars are flowing?

00:24:24.800 --> 00:24:28.490
Make a snowman with me on my birthday next month, okay?

00:24:28.970 --> 00:24:30.260
It's a promise!

00:24:35.900 --> 00:24:37.100
Do I look like a lady?

00:24:41.830 --> 00:24:42.580
What?

00:24:44.300 --> 00:24:46.440
What do you mean, "that's not it"?

00:24:49.190 --> 00:24:50.680
Are you talking to me?

00:24:57.170 --> 00:25:00.290
Crossing... time?!

00:25:31.330 --> 00:25:32.400
It's beautiful...

00:25:57.170 --> 00:25:58.900
Onee-sama!

00:26:14.560 --> 00:26:17.110
Onee-sama!!

00:26:18.630 --> 00:26:21.480
Look! Isn't it cute?

00:26:24.700 --> 00:26:30.200
This snowman's smiling so sweetly!

00:26:42.970 --> 00:26:45.280
You really are a dodo head...

00:26:51.620 --> 00:26:54.030
To Be Continued

00:26:54.080 --> 00:27:01.230
Crying, laughing, I can never tell
naitari warattari itsumo wakaranai

00:27:02.890 --> 00:27:07.050
People are mysterious creatures
hito wa fushigi na ikimono

00:27:07.050 --> 00:27:11.480
Getting upset over being lonely
sabishii noni okotteru

00:27:11.480 --> 00:27:14.640
Getting upset over being happy
ureshii noni okotteru

00:27:15.660 --> 00:27:21.530
Getting lost even when they put on airs
kidottemo mayotte iru no

00:27:21.530 --> 00:27:24.130
Why is it?
doushite na no?

00:27:24.530 --> 00:27:28.220
No matter how many times you stumble
nando tsumazuichattemo

00:27:28.220 --> 00:27:33.330
Stand back up, smile, and face forward
tachiagatte sou waratte mae muite

00:27:33.330 --> 00:27:40.630
Surely when tomorrow comes, you will be a bit different
kitto ashita ni nattara sukoshi kawatte irareru

00:27:41.330 --> 00:27:45.030
Bye-bye, stardust tears
bye bye hoshikuzu namida

00:28:03.900 --> 00:28:07.490
May this feeling reach that person...
douka konna omoi ga

00:28:07.490 --> 00:28:12.150
And the world, and the universe
ano hito ni sekai ni uchuu ni made

00:28:12.150 --> 00:28:19.890
Another one spills down
todokimasu you ni tomata hitotsu koboreochiru

00:28:20.620 --> 00:28:29.740
Bye-bye, stardust tears
bye bye hoshikuzu namida

